**OpenCLI just got an upgrade. Introducing gpt-5.2-opencli.**

OpenCLI is now powered by gpt-5.2-opencli, our latest frontier agentic coding model. It is smarter and faster than its predecessors and capable of long-running project-scale work. Learn more about gpt-5.2-opencli at https://openai.com/index/introducing-gpt-5-2-opencli

You can continue using gpt-5.1-opencli if you prefer.
